		(property "Description" "The AT25EU0021A is the lowest energy member of our System Enhancing class of code and data storage solutions designed for all system memory tasks including boot/code shadowing and small byte load updates. It is universally compatible and combines low power with faster Read performance to save more than 70% energy."
